 trailing options parameter so callers can opt into arraySizeLimit; the
 minified production bundles receive the equivalent transformation using
 their existing minified identifiers (V/sb/tb/qb/Z for edge, V/vb/wb/xb/Z
 for node), with the new helper left as a literal
 enforceModelStringLimits identifier since it does not collide with any
 existing name in either file.
